&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Solutions Engineer to be on the front lines, working closely with our strategic customers and prospects, guiding them on how to build robust and secured business critical DevOps and software development processes in the age of agentic development. You will work with our Sales, Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams to help customers understand the value of JFrog solutions from a technical and business perspective. If you love working with brilliant people, being part of an energetic team and changing the world of software, you might be the perfect Frog to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
